            "title": "MARCEL OraShield: Oral Rinse",
            "items": "Dilute 5 to 10 drops (roughly ½ mL) in about 160 mL of lukewarm water.\nRinse and gargle for 20 to 30 seconds.\nSpit out the solution. Do not swallow.\nUse twice daily, or as advised by your physician or MARCEL OSMF Consultant."
