      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Who this is for",
        "heading": "Honest Guidance: <em>Is This Kit Right for You?</em>",
        "text": "We want every patient to make an informed decision based on their diagnosis, stage and individual situation.",
        "yes_title": "This programme may be suitable to discuss if:",
        "yes_items": "A qualified healthcare professional has assessed you and considers you suitable within the Stage 3 and Stage 4 OSMF care framework.\nYou are looking for a structured oral-care routine rather than trying individual products without guidance.\nYou experience ongoing oral tightness, burning discomfort, restricted mouth opening or difficulties with eating and oral hygiene.\nYou want the two core products, MARCEL OraShield and MARCEL Smile, to form part of one organised daily routine.\nYou are prepared to follow the recommended routine and take part in the full 12-week care journey, with professional review as advised.",
        "no_title": "Consider getting guidance first if:",
        "no_items": "You have not been examined or are unsure whether your symptoms are due to OSMF. Arrange a professional assessment before choosing a programme.\nYou are in an early stage, have mild symptoms or are unsure whether the Advance Programme is appropriate. The right approach depends on your clinical assessment.\nYou want to try one product on its own before choosing a kit. Discuss the most appropriate option with a healthcare professional.\nYou would like help understanding the products or programme. Contact MARCEL Team for general assistance, or request a teleconsultation with a MARCEL OSMF Consultant.\nYou have a persistent mouth ulcer, a red or white patch, a lump, unexplained bleeding or rapidly worsening symptoms. Seek prompt in-person examination rather than relying on a product kit.",
        "link_1_label": "Contact MARCEL Team",
