        "link_2_label": "Request teleconsultation",
        "link_2_to": "consult",
        "link_2": "",
        "note": "Symptoms alone cannot confirm OSMF or determine its stage. The Advance Programme is intended for patients assessed by a qualified healthcare professional as suitable within the Stage 3 and Stage 4 framework. It does not replace diagnosis, individualised treatment planning, indicated medical or dental care, or referral.",
